#. runtime
msgid "Signed, not in a block yet. The wallet keeps sending it through Tor by itself. If Tor does not come up, choose below: wait for Tor and try again; send this one payment directly — the node then sees the address of your device; or switch Tor off for everything, so that you are not asked again. This text can be passed to the recipient as proof that you signed. A signed payment cannot be cancelled; while it is in no block you can try to take it back - below."
